  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCPF: Enabling organizational capacity for enhancing farm livelihoods including PGS  Agri-Nutri-garden</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide detailed technical guidance to the DAY-NRLM to finalize a training material on Participatory Guarantee Scheme (PGS) certification and Agri-Nutri-garden as well as develop a compendium of best practices on-farm livelihoods and success stories of CRPs for the use of DAY-NRLM.</narrative>
  </description>
